stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open: raised from a failed test or eval
  Open --> InRemediation: owner starts the fix
  InRemediation --> ReadyForRetest: fix done
  ReadyForRetest --> Closed: retest passed and reviewed
  ReadyForRetest --> InRemediation: retest failed
  Open --> RiskAccepted: accepted with a reason
  InRemediation --> RiskAccepted: accepted with a reason
  Closed --> Open: reopened
  RiskAccepted --> Open: reopened
